    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on updating our SOPs for the security team at my boutique hotel. We really pride ourselves on a quiet, high-end atmosphere for our VIPs. I want to help my staff identify different guest profiles early on so they know when to step up monitoring to prevent any potential disruptions or noise issues. Can you help me draft some profiles of groups or types of guests that typically require more proactive security presence to keep things orderly?",
